WEBVTT

00:00:00.470 --> 00:00:06.850
<i>If I am to devote my life to someone,
I will surpass my limitation.</i>

00:00:07.070 --> 00:00:12.340
<i>Now and here,
I will become my own strength.</i>

00:00:12.350 --> 00:00:16.490
<i>And I will march toward the future.</i>

00:00:19.280 --> 00:00:25.600
<i>There are places I like to forget.
There are memories I like to forget.</i>

00:00:25.680 --> 00:00:31.950
<i>I can't get rid of this swirling hesitation...
and my pride is wounded.</i>

00:00:32.000 --> 00:00:38.080
<i>The light is covered in dust,
if you see through the darkness...</i>

00:00:38.200 --> 00:00:44.500
<i>You can find your path to the new door.</i>

00:00:44.520 --> 00:00:50.730
<i>Beautiful sword dances like the wind.</i>

00:00:51.020 --> 00:00:57.650
<i>Fate so strong, it creates miracles in my life.</i>

00:00:57.670 --> 00:01:00.220
<i>Flower of Bravery.</i>

00:01:00.220 --> 00:01:07.100
<i>Looking only for the truth.
I noticed you were there beside me.</i>

00:01:07.160 --> 00:01:12.820
<i>Your special soul will be our bond.</i>

00:01:12.980 --> 00:01:19.550
<i>A sadness I can't break free reflects in the depths of my memory.</i>

00:01:19.710 --> 00:01:24.850
<i>Now and here, my sadness will be my strength.</i>

00:01:24.930 --> 00:01:27.520
<i>And I will march toward the future.</i>

00:01:47.620 --> 00:01:55.340
<b>Chōhi Battles with Bachō</b>

00:02:27.810 --> 00:02:32.370
Iishe, Toshi.  What’s wrong to make both of you come and see me?

00:02:33.510 --> 00:02:37.510
Lord Reiha, Sōsō would like to see you.

00:02:38.120 --> 00:02:41.810
I just woke up and finished taking a bath.

00:02:42.110 --> 00:02:45.800
I don’t want to ruin my morning, by seeing that annoying brat!

00:02:46.330 --> 00:02:49.000
Umm…, Lord Reiha, it’s already noon.

00:02:49.660 --> 00:02:52.200
You know, sleep deprivation is the skin’s worst enemy.

00:02:54.050 --> 00:02:59.880
Anyways, since she has come all the way from the capital to capture the bandits in our territory...

00:03:00.010 --> 00:03:01.770
We can’t just turn her away.

00:03:01.770 --> 00:03:03.170
Of course, I know that!

00:03:03.660 --> 00:03:07.560
I will greet her, as soon as I am dressed.  Please ask her to wait for a bit longer.

00:03:11.200 --> 00:03:15.410
It must be tough to travel all the way from the capital just to capture the bandits, Sōsō.

00:03:15.850 --> 00:03:20.070
Yes, usually there is no need for my help, but...

00:03:20.240 --> 00:03:24.280
It’s a different story, if the bandits settle in your territory.

00:03:25.680 --> 00:03:29.230
It’s almost as if we let them escape, if I don’t get involved.

00:03:29.720 --> 00:03:32.390
Hey, what do you mean by that?

00:03:32.530 --> 00:03:37.440
I mean you are a useless lord who can’t even handle a single bandit.

00:03:39.280 --> 00:03:42.660
Sōsō, you are being extremely disrespectful to our lord!

00:03:42.790 --> 00:03:47.030
Even if what you say is true, certain things are better left unsaid...

00:03:47.050 --> 00:03:48.890
Hey, what was that?

00:03:49.070 --> 00:03:51.870
Umm, sorry I couldn’t control my mouth!

00:03:51.960 --> 00:03:53.230
WHAT?

00:03:55.120 --> 00:04:00.250
A bumbling vassal and a useless lord, what a great combination.  Can’t beat that!

00:04:00.740 --> 00:04:02.230
Ha!  You’re admitting defeat!

00:04:02.270 --> 00:04:05.120
You know, she is mocking us?

00:04:05.210 --> 00:04:06.180
Oh really?

00:04:13.500 --> 00:04:17.940
Geez, I was so embarrassed by you two!

00:04:18.240 --> 00:04:20.660
“You two?”  But I didn’t…

00:04:20.740 --> 00:04:25.660
Since she’s here, should we really leave everything to Sōsō?

00:04:26.800 --> 00:04:31.840
That’s fine.  Let the brat do the dirty work.

00:04:32.770 --> 00:04:36.580
Changing the subject, how is the martial art tournament going?

00:04:41.240 --> 00:04:44.120
Lord Karin, how was Lord Enshou?

00:04:44.200 --> 00:04:49.820
As usual, she’s mistaking the fame of her family name for competency as a ruler.

00:04:50.500 --> 00:04:54.970
It really angers me that an idiot like her enjoys a landlord post.

00:04:55.750 --> 00:04:57.930
Shunran, how are the troops doing?

00:04:58.260 --> 00:05:01.250
They are already waiting outside of the gates.

00:05:01.570 --> 00:05:04.430
We can leave soon as we regroup.

00:05:04.730 --> 00:05:05.410
I see.

00:05:07.420 --> 00:05:10.110
Wow!  What a curly top!

00:05:10.160 --> 00:05:14.850
Please forgive her rudeness; she meant your hair.

00:05:14.900 --> 00:05:17.160
She wasn't talking about your head.

00:05:24.420 --> 00:05:28.430
A silly comment by a child does not deserve punishment.

00:05:30.370 --> 00:05:31.650
Who’s a child?

00:05:31.700 --> 00:05:32.680
Be quiet.

00:05:32.830 --> 00:05:34.030
Speaking of hair…

00:05:34.110 --> 00:05:35.040
What?

00:05:35.590 --> 00:05:38.470
Your hair is quite beautiful.

00:05:38.800 --> 00:05:42.590
You're being too kind.  It is not something worth praising.

00:05:42.740 --> 00:05:45.780
Does the beauty match all the hair on your body?

00:05:46.560 --> 00:05:50.370
Aisha’s legs are shiny and wet.

00:05:50.400 --> 00:05:52.140
Hey, watch what you’re saying.

00:05:52.260 --> 00:05:55.470
I would really like to see that.

00:05:55.920 --> 00:05:57.700
Umm… well… no… umm…

00:05:58.260 --> 00:06:00.890
Unfortunately, I have important business to attend to.

00:06:01.340 --> 00:06:04.160
My name is Sōsō, luck permitted, we should meet gain.

00:06:08.250 --> 00:06:10.580
W-who was she…

00:06:11.010 --> 00:06:14.950
So that’s the famous Sōsō?  She is dangerous.

00:06:17.070 --> 00:06:19.430
Welcome back master!

00:06:26.440 --> 00:06:28.570
Why do I have to dress like this?

00:06:28.730 --> 00:06:32.680
Because we are short on money for tonight’s lodging.

00:06:33.070 --> 00:06:36.890
This is the best paying job I could find.

00:06:37.110 --> 00:06:42.240
But having to say “my master” to strangers is beneath me.

00:06:42.330 --> 00:06:46.190
Welcome back my master.  Please this way.

00:06:48.650 --> 00:06:50.090
Now, my master.

00:06:53.430 --> 00:06:56.850
Sei, aren’t you taking this job a bit too serious?

00:06:57.070 --> 00:06:58.870
We can’t fight on an empty stomach.

00:06:59.480 --> 00:07:06.280
Without money, we can’t continue our journey.  Think of it as part of our strategy, it will make the job easier.

00:07:07.120 --> 00:07:09.790
Welcome back, master.

00:07:11.240 --> 00:07:12.950
How shrewd of you, Chōun Shiryū.

00:07:13.660 --> 00:07:14.660
Sorry for the wait.

00:07:15.630 --> 00:07:20.370
I ordered the large size, and this isn’t large?

00:07:23.660 --> 00:07:26.200
This is the large serving for this restaurant.

00:07:26.250 --> 00:07:27.130
You!

00:07:28.090 --> 00:07:31.470
I am sorry.  I will bring you another one right away!

00:07:32.960 --> 00:07:37.000
You know, you're not supposed to sample customers’ orders.

00:07:37.440 --> 00:07:39.940
I was hungry, I couldn’t help it.

00:07:40.020 --> 00:07:42.660
That’s not an excuse, you need to behave yourself.

00:07:44.280 --> 00:07:47.660
I am sorry.  I will try harder next time.

00:07:50.030 --> 00:07:51.390
Hot!  Hot!  Hot!

00:07:54.330 --> 00:07:57.880
Rin Rin, go back to the inn and wait for us.

00:07:59.240 --> 00:08:02.360
It's not fair, I didn’t mess up that bad.

00:08:02.660 --> 00:08:07.930
I have to somehow make lots of money and surprise Aisha.

00:08:14.770 --> 00:08:17.710
Too many hard words, I can’t read it.

00:08:17.930 --> 00:08:21.840
“Kishuu’s No.1 Martial Art tournament will be held today.  Open to all contestants!"

00:08:21.930 --> 00:08:25.520
"Winner will be awarded cash and prizes.”  That’s what it says.

00:08:25.960 --> 00:08:31.400
Winner gets cash?  That means if I win, I can get lots of money!?

00:08:31.580 --> 00:08:37.850
Well yes, that’s true but…  I hope you are not serious about the winning part.

00:08:37.940 --> 00:08:39.430
Of course I am serious!

00:08:40.000 --> 00:08:43.200
You are quite confident, but it would be impossible.

00:08:43.510 --> 00:08:44.870
Why is that?

00:08:45.570 --> 00:08:50.660
That’s easy, I am going to win the tournament.

00:08:59.090 --> 00:09:02.420
Kishuu’s No.1 martial art tournament has finally begun!

00:09:02.640 --> 00:09:04.880
From Yuushuu to the North and Houtou to the South.

00:09:04.970 --> 00:09:11.500
Strong and skilled fighters will face each other to compete in the tournament.

00:09:12.210 --> 00:09:16.720
Before we start the matches, let me introduce the tournament’s sponsor.

00:09:17.600 --> 00:09:22.120
From one of the most prominent families, the ruler of Kishuu, Lord Enshou!

00:09:26.330 --> 00:09:29.930
Welcome to the martial art tournament hosted by yours truly.

00:09:30.330 --> 00:09:35.850
Please enjoy the competition among the most skilled fighters from around the country.

00:09:41.600 --> 00:09:44.700
Thank you, thank you.  The prestigious En-family has always…

00:09:44.720 --> 00:09:50.730
Thanks to an aspiring speech from Lord Enshou, let’s start the first match!

00:09:54.060 --> 00:09:58.580
Possibly, the top contender, the axe-wielding Tetsuryuu will be competing against...

00:09:59.060 --> 00:10:03.540
The smallest, rather the youngest contestant Chōhi.

00:10:04.020 --> 00:10:09.070
As much as we like to cheer Chōhi on, who joined us so unexpectedly...

00:10:09.110 --> 00:10:10.910
Unfortunately, her luck might not hold up.

00:10:17.760 --> 00:10:22.190
Wow, Tetsuryuu strikes first!  It looks like it's going to end before…

00:10:23.020 --> 00:10:30.610
She blocked the strike from the axe, which is so heavy even lifting it is a feat.

00:10:31.220 --> 00:10:32.980
You little brat!

00:10:34.780 --> 00:10:37.850
You are not strong enough to beat Rin Rin!

00:10:49.650 --> 00:10:50.440
She did it!

00:10:50.710 --> 00:10:55.140
Chōhi defeated the top contendor, Tetsuryuu.

00:10:55.270 --> 00:10:57.730
What an unexpected turn of events!

00:11:01.020 --> 00:11:05.750
Now to our second match!  Already in progress.

00:11:05.970 --> 00:11:11.810
Bachō, hailing from the far west, has been in training most of her life.

00:11:12.640 --> 00:11:16.240
On the other hand, her opponent, is a famous spear master.

00:11:21.370 --> 00:11:24.400
Wow, the action is so fast!  Our eyes can’t keep track.

00:11:24.880 --> 00:11:27.560
Bachō can’t do anything but defend.

00:11:29.010 --> 00:11:30.940
Finished already?

00:11:31.030 --> 00:11:31.550
What?

00:11:32.650 --> 00:11:35.460
Well, I guess it is my turn now.

00:11:41.420 --> 00:11:43.750
Don’t worry, I avoided the vital organs.

00:11:49.280 --> 00:11:52.090
She does it again, Chōhi delivers another knockout!

00:11:53.310 --> 00:11:56.080
Wow!  No match for Bachō!

00:11:57.000 --> 00:12:01.390
Chōhi, the small giant is very close to becoming our new champion!

00:12:02.270 --> 00:12:07.970
Bachō breezes through the semi-final round!  Is this the birth of a new legend?

00:12:11.040 --> 00:12:14.160
It is the final match for Kishuu’s No.1 Martial Art tournament.

00:12:14.240 --> 00:12:19.380
These two have defeated strong opponents and secured a spot in the final round.

00:12:19.510 --> 00:12:21.970
First, the fearless small tornado, Chōhi!

00:12:22.670 --> 00:12:25.960
Her opponent Bachō, the wild horse of the west!

00:12:26.260 --> 00:12:29.470
The final round is upon us, this match will decide the strongest fighter.

00:12:30.040 --> 00:12:32.930
The final match will return right after this.

00:12:31.620 --> 00:12:32.930
<b>We'll be right back.</b>

00:12:32.930 --> 00:12:35.390
<b>Bathroom</b>

00:12:48.510 --> 00:12:51.930
I didn’t think you’d make it this far.

00:12:55.620 --> 00:12:56.580
Bring it on!

00:12:57.460 --> 00:13:00.840
I'm going to beat you and win the prize money.

00:13:16.810 --> 00:13:17.950
You’re not too bad!

00:13:18.520 --> 00:13:19.440
Right back at you!

00:13:19.920 --> 00:13:21.680
Wow, amazing.

00:13:22.210 --> 00:13:25.150
This is an exciting final match.

00:13:28.790 --> 00:13:32.740
How in the world is this little runt so strong?

00:13:34.580 --> 00:13:37.610
But the strongest here is…

00:13:38.400 --> 00:13:41.340
ME!

00:13:50.200 --> 00:13:52.650
This is not a joking matter!  Be serious.

00:13:52.740 --> 00:13:53.930
I am sorry!

00:13:54.150 --> 00:13:55.460
Geez.

00:13:55.680 --> 00:13:59.100
Your growling stomach killed the suspense of my final blow.

00:14:06.430 --> 00:14:07.440
You two, that’s enough!

00:14:09.460 --> 00:14:14.110
I am calling this match a draw.  I declare both, winners.

00:14:18.890 --> 00:14:22.010
<b>Applause</b>

00:14:24.550 --> 00:14:26.920
Finally, some ME time.

00:14:27.540 --> 00:14:31.000
Now for my closing speech, I, the prestigious, Lord…

00:14:32.580 --> 00:14:35.390
My next job is at…

00:14:40.740 --> 00:14:42.630
Delicious!

00:14:44.250 --> 00:14:45.790
What a feast!

00:14:49.030 --> 00:14:52.020
Enjoy your food.  Eat as much as you like.

00:14:52.190 --> 00:14:57.020
You two fought brilliantly today.

00:15:00.490 --> 00:15:03.380
So, I'd like to ask a favor of you two.

00:15:03.640 --> 00:15:07.680
I'd like you two to accept a position as acting generals for the En-family.

00:15:10.400 --> 00:15:12.380
What’s acting general?

00:15:12.460 --> 00:15:17.820
Hmm well…, in simple terms, it means temporary.

00:15:17.900 --> 00:15:19.180
I see.

00:15:19.260 --> 00:15:22.600
If I accept your offer, can I have a feast like this every day?

00:15:24.700 --> 00:15:26.020
Of course.

00:15:26.420 --> 00:15:31.460
3 meals a day prepared by the best chefs.

00:15:31.640 --> 00:15:33.080
Then I will accept!

00:15:33.220 --> 00:15:34.970
I guess it won’t hurt for a little while.

00:15:39.890 --> 00:15:44.360
It’s been a while since I’ve been in a battle; I am out of shape.

00:15:44.800 --> 00:15:46.200
Toshi, big problem!

00:15:46.290 --> 00:15:48.920
What is it Iishe; don’t just barge in!

00:15:49.010 --> 00:15:53.220
It seems Lord Reiha is offering a job to Chōhi and Bachō.

00:15:53.350 --> 00:15:57.220
That’s not a bad idea.  Their strength will help us grow stronger.

00:15:57.570 --> 00:15:59.430
How can you say that?

00:15:59.450 --> 00:16:04.980
Right now, we are her trusted subordinates, if she keeps recruiting strong fighters…

00:16:05.900 --> 00:16:07.180
You have a point there.

00:16:07.750 --> 00:16:08.930
What should we do?

00:16:08.970 --> 00:16:10.820
What should we do you ask?

00:16:10.900 --> 00:16:12.530
I have a plan…

00:16:17.270 --> 00:16:17.790
What?

00:16:18.360 --> 00:16:22.400
You’re asking me not to recruit Chōhi and Bachō.  Why is that?

00:16:23.500 --> 00:16:25.820
That’s not exactly what I said…

00:16:25.820 --> 00:16:29.240
You both saw their strength and skills.

00:16:29.420 --> 00:16:33.810
With strong followers, we can even take on Sōsō.

00:16:34.250 --> 00:16:37.410
We do agree that they are skilled martial artists, but...

00:16:37.540 --> 00:16:43.280
Do they fit the Enshou’s army motto “Strong, beautiful and clever”?

00:16:45.260 --> 00:16:48.240
True, they don’t seem to be very elegant.

00:16:48.810 --> 00:16:50.220
That’s right!

00:16:50.520 --> 00:16:53.900
<i>Even though we used to be bandits…</i>

00:16:54.120 --> 00:16:56.670
I have an idea.

00:16:57.500 --> 00:16:58.380
An idea?

00:16:58.680 --> 00:17:04.870
Yes, we are going to see if Chōhi and Bachō are worthy of becoming your subordinates.

00:17:05.270 --> 00:17:08.070
I see an assessment exam.

00:17:08.210 --> 00:17:09.130
Yes.

00:17:10.840 --> 00:17:12.110
Sure.

00:17:12.770 --> 00:17:19.220
<i>Now all we have to do is give them an impossible task, let them believe they failed, and kick them out….</i>

00:17:19.260 --> 00:17:21.850
I will decide on the test.

00:17:21.890 --> 00:17:22.770
What?!

00:17:22.770 --> 00:17:25.490
And you two will compete against them.

00:17:25.540 --> 00:17:27.550
Did you say compete?

00:17:28.430 --> 00:17:32.510
Win and prove your worthiness.

00:17:33.000 --> 00:17:37.210
Then I will keep you as my second in command.

00:17:37.780 --> 00:17:40.410
But, if you lose…

00:17:40.800 --> 00:17:42.870
If we lose…?

00:17:43.530 --> 00:17:44.840
Chop!  Chop!

00:17:45.410 --> 00:17:47.210
You mean we lose our head?

00:17:47.250 --> 00:17:50.110
No, you idiots, it means you get fired!

00:17:50.190 --> 00:17:51.600
Phew, it just…

00:17:52.210 --> 00:17:54.060
What?  Getting fired?!

00:17:59.190 --> 00:18:02.300
Now is the time to begin the Enshou Army’s surprise assessment exam.

00:18:02.960 --> 00:18:07.700
The new Chōhi-Bachō team will face against the well known Bunshū-Ganryou team.

00:18:07.880 --> 00:18:11.520
They will compete in strength, ingenuity and beauty categories.

00:18:13.360 --> 00:18:15.420
We will start with the ingenuity assessment.

00:18:25.910 --> 00:18:27.440
Umm, this is…

00:18:28.450 --> 00:18:30.910
I suck at thinking…

00:18:30.950 --> 00:18:33.540
This is not the time or place to contemplate your weaknesses…

00:18:34.070 --> 00:18:36.350
This is easy!

00:18:36.660 --> 00:18:40.260
Just bring the chair over and…  Huh!
Eh, I can’t reach it!

00:18:42.540 --> 00:18:47.490
You idiot!  You have to use this tool.  See.

00:18:50.170 --> 00:18:52.150
Huh!  I can’t reach it either.

00:18:54.080 --> 00:18:59.520
First this…  And then this.  It should be easy now.

00:19:01.140 --> 00:19:02.460
Oh, that’s how it works!

00:19:02.890 --> 00:19:06.320
Witness the power of intelligence, 34 points!

00:19:08.120 --> 00:19:11.630
I am depressed despite my win…

00:19:13.600 --> 00:19:17.590
Next is the beauty assessment, an essential part of our army.

00:19:19.390 --> 00:19:21.500
There are so many interesting clothes in here!

00:19:21.540 --> 00:19:25.010
Geez, I don’t have any fashion sense…

00:19:25.320 --> 00:19:30.490
It seems they are ready!  First we have the Chōhi-Bachō team!

00:19:30.970 --> 00:19:33.170
Roar!  Roar!  Roar!

00:19:41.020 --> 00:19:43.790
Please don’t stare...

00:19:43.830 --> 00:19:47.820
Fancy clothing doesn’t flatter me.

00:19:48.260 --> 00:19:52.520
Umm, Bachō appears to be extremely popular with most of the audience!

00:19:52.610 --> 00:19:55.760
Everyone in the audience please cast your vote!

00:19:58.620 --> 00:20:03.400
We asked the Kishuu Wild Bird Club to help us with collecting the votes.

00:20:05.020 --> 00:20:07.610
The votes have been tallied!

00:20:08.400 --> 00:20:09.670
87 points!

00:20:10.240 --> 00:20:15.900
Quite an impressive score!  Can the Bunshū-Ganryou team beat this?

00:20:16.390 --> 00:20:19.190
Hey, they are not that bad.

00:20:19.330 --> 00:20:22.350
Do we really have to dress up like this?

00:20:22.400 --> 00:20:25.730
What are you talking about? This is a matter of win or death!

00:20:25.860 --> 00:20:26.960
But still…

00:20:27.090 --> 00:20:27.920
Here we go!

00:20:28.060 --> 00:20:30.950
Evil bandits who take advantage of troubled times and disturb the peace!

00:20:31.040 --> 00:20:33.370
Will be punished in the name of the Kan Dynasty!

00:20:50.870 --> 00:20:54.470
Umm, audience your vote please…

00:20:54.820 --> 00:20:57.410
Their score is very low...

00:20:58.330 --> 00:21:02.100
87 to 13, a clear victory for the Chōhi-Bachō team.

00:21:02.540 --> 00:21:04.210
Yay!  We did it.

00:21:07.020 --> 00:21:08.070
We lost...

00:21:08.250 --> 00:21:11.620
We lost, despite giving it our best.

00:21:12.330 --> 00:21:15.840
The final test is the strength assessment.

00:21:18.910 --> 00:21:22.290
However, you will not face each other using weapons…

00:21:22.370 --> 00:21:25.840
You will be using the En-family’s traditional...

00:21:26.280 --> 00:21:32.600
Beautiful and stylish swan loincloth!
We will have a female wrestling match!

00:21:32.860 --> 00:21:34.310
Whaaaaaat?

00:21:42.510 --> 00:21:44.750
This is embarrassing!

00:21:44.930 --> 00:21:49.970
It all comes down to this final match.
We are waiting for the Chōhi-Bachō team.

00:21:50.670 --> 00:21:53.480
Eh?  Hm.  Uh Huh.

00:21:54.710 --> 00:21:59.360
We have disappointing news.

00:21:59.400 --> 00:22:03.920
The Chōhi-Bachō team has forfeited this match.

00:22:08.790 --> 00:22:12.740
I just could not wear that ridiculous loincloth!

00:22:12.790 --> 00:22:16.300
Me neither.  It was a bit too much even for me.

00:22:17.040 --> 00:22:23.710
If this little trial makes them run away, they‘re not worthy to become the subordinates of the majestic En-family!

00:22:24.540 --> 00:22:28.930
The Bunshū-Ganryou team beats the Chōhi-Bachō team two to one.

00:22:31.170 --> 00:22:33.630
We won, we won!

00:22:33.670 --> 00:22:35.780
We did it!

00:22:35.820 --> 00:22:40.380
We might have lost our dignity, but we won!

00:22:40.430 --> 00:22:41.350
Yes!

00:22:45.210 --> 00:22:46.610
I am back!

00:22:46.750 --> 00:22:48.110
You!

00:22:49.730 --> 00:22:51.920
Where have you been all day?

00:22:52.270 --> 00:22:58.640
I told you to stay put at the inn!  Where were you all night?

00:22:59.030 --> 00:23:02.100
We were worried sick about you yesterday!

00:23:02.850 --> 00:23:03.720
Who are you?

00:23:03.940 --> 00:23:08.590
Umm, nice to meet you.  My name is Bachō.

00:23:09.300 --> 00:23:10.660
Bachō is…

00:23:11.710 --> 00:23:14.040
My new friend!

00:23:28.650 --> 00:23:33.650
<i>I am the heroine of this world, no matter what.</i>

00:23:33.740 --> 00:23:39.000
<i>Such a splendid world,
no questions asked, because I said so.</i>

00:23:40.050 --> 00:23:44.350
<i>Anywhere I am, it always turns into paradise.</i>

00:23:45.360 --> 00:23:49.050
<i>Every season, mellow and carefree.
Today and tomorrow, always an adventure.</i>

00:23:49.090 --> 00:23:54.220
<i>I run away when times are tough.
But get involved when easy and fun.</i>

00:23:54.270 --> 00:23:59.400
<i>If I stress, I just stop and smell the roses.  If there's a great opportunity, I go for it!</i>

00:23:59.400 --> 00:24:04.490
<i>There are so many things that I want.</i>

00:24:04.540 --> 00:24:12.080
<i>I am so brave, that I can take on the invincible.</i>

00:24:12.210 --> 00:24:17.260
<i>After all said and done, I am the heroine of this world.</i>

00:24:17.390 --> 00:24:22.480
<i>The world revolves around me.  I am the center of the world!</i>

00:24:22.480 --> 00:24:27.480
<i>I am the heroine of this world, no matter what.</i>

00:24:27.610 --> 00:24:32.920
<i>Such a splendid world,
no questions asked, because I said so.</i>

00:24:42.520 --> 00:24:45.200
<b>Cutie-cute</b>
